OL,3,GNEWSANo action over social media posts
OL,4,Aduring Donohoe inquest, says attorney
OL,5,Ageneral
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Attorney General (AG) for Northern
OL,8,FIreland has decided to take no action
OL,9,Fover inappropriate social media content
OL,10,Frelating to the Noah Donohoe inquest.
OL,12,FThe attorney general has concluded that
OL,13,F"it would not be in the public
OL,14,Finterest" to bring contempt of court
OL,15,Fproceedings.
OL,17,FThe coroner at the inquest, Mr Justice
OL,18,FRooney, referred matters to the
OL,19,Fattorney general on a number of
OL,20,Foccasions during the hearings into the
OL,21,Fdeath of the schoolboy.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
