OL,3,GNEWSANo action over social media posts
OL,4,Aduring Donohoe inquest, says attorney
OL,5,Ageneral
OL,6,
OL,7,FNoah died in north Belfast more than
OL,8,Fsix years ago and a verdict into his
OL,9,Fdisappearance and death was delivered
OL,10,Fin September.
